  "index_test": "whole-animal-in-vivo",
  "index_test_evidence": "The present study aimed to further validate the clinical translatability of GAN diet-induced liver lesions by comparing liver biopsy histopathological and transcriptome characteristics in GAN DIO-NASH mice and human NASH patients.",
  "decision": "include",
  "reason": "The study compares whole-animal (mouse) results with human clinical results, specifically comparing liver histopathology and transcriptome characteristics between GAN DIO-NASH mice and human NASH patients. This directly addresses the concordance between animal models and human outcomes."
